{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>CHIIKAWA SHOP登陸廣深兩地！廣州天河城店與深圳南山海岸城店接連開幕。今次雙城店鋪特別以「嶺南武術」為主題，重磅推出廣東獨家限定功夫系列！小可愛8位角色都換上充滿中華元素的功夫服裝，擺出型格又可愛的功夫姿勢！現場除了滿滿的反差萌功夫造型打卡位外，更首發限定功夫服裝公仔！</p><p>地址：深圳市南山區海岸城購物中心二層 290-291 號舖、廣東省廣州市天河區天河城購物中心</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069764062143927_3579374146abbe0a8def1d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069764251389283_16562295716abbe0abae240.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069764658943383_15538454806abbe0aeeeb3c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069764839062081_9399410636abbe0b0ace0c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069765015237007_6097580956abbe0b2ed2ef.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1790697652776712_870519246abbe0b50e2ad.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179069765423859672_7207587896abbe0b6c9809.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T16:18:12.440763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}